---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms &amp; Conditions"
  description="The terms governing use of CheatCodeGTAVI.com, an unofficial GTA 6 cheat codes, leaks, and news tracker."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms &amp; Conditions" subtitle={`Last updated ${lastUpdated}.`} accent="gold" />

  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-8 px-5 py-14 text-text-secondary sm:px-8 sm:py-20" data-reveal-group>
    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Acceptance of terms</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        By using CheatCodeGTAVI.com, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Not an official Rockstar or Take-Two site</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        CheatCodeGTAVI.com is an independent, unofficial fan resource. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
        sponsored by Rockstar Games, Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc., or any of their subsidiaries. Grand Theft
        Auto, GTA6, and all related names, characters, and imagery are trademarks and copyrighted property of
        Take-Two Interactive Software, Inc. and its subsidiaries. Nothing on this site should be taken as an
        official statement from Rockstar Games.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Content accuracy</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        We work to verify leaks and cheat codes against multiple independent sources before labeling anything
        "Verified" (see our <a href="/faq" class="text-accent-secondary hover:text-accent-secondary/80">FAQ</a>),
        but GTA 6 has not launched and information about it is inherently subject to change. Content on this site
        — including release dates, cheat codes, character details, and leaks — is provided "as is," without
        warranty of any kind, and may be updated, corrected, or removed at any time as new information emerges.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Cheat code use</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        Any cheat codes published here are informational only. Using cheat codes in-game is entirely at your own
        discretion and risk, including any effect on achievements/trophies or online play eligibility, per the
        game's own rules.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Third-party links</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        Leak and news articles link back to their original sources. We aren't responsible for the content,
        accuracy, or availability of external sites we link to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        Don't attempt to disrupt the site, scrape it at abusive volume, or use it to distribute malware, spam, or
        illegal content. We reserve the right to block access from any source that does.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        CheatCodeGTAVI.com is provided free of charge with no guarantee of uptime, accuracy, or fitness for a
        particular purpose. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of, or reliance on, this site.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        We may update these terms as the site evolves. Continued use after a change means you accept the updated
        terms.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-heading-sm text-text-primary">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-body-md">
        Questions about these terms? Visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-accent-secondary hover:text-accent-secondary/80">Contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
